phpBB Norwegian (Bokmål) translation
====================================

Current target: phpBB 3.3.19
Language code: nb

Repository layout
-----------------

* `en/` contains the official British English language files used as the
  reference for the target phpBB release.
* `nb/` contains the Norwegian Bokmål translation.

History
-------

The original phpBB 3.0.9 translation history is preserved. The official
Norwegian language packs for phpBB 3.1.2 and 3.1.3 were imported as separate
commits before rebuilding the translation for phpBB 3.3.19.

Original project initiated by fox-body and baxon.
